    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d782">

                <pb facs="0939" n="845" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg845"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lee to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-01-28"><hi rendition="#italic">January 28,
                        1897</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Sanguily signed personal pledge to me that he will faithfully observe terms
                    already mailed. Recommend case be considered on said terms.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
